flowchart TB
    U[Cliente / Atendente] -->|HTTP| LB

    subgraph GH[GitHub Actions - ci.yml unico]
        direction TB
        CI[Etapas 1 a 7<br/>build, testes, dependency-check,<br/>trivy, sonar, relatorio]
        CD[Etapa 8 - deploy<br/>so na branch deploy-google-cloud<br/>build e push da imagem, kubectl apply]
        CI --> CD
    end

    subgraph GKE[GKE Autopilot - namespace oficina]
        direction TB
        LB[Service LoadBalancer<br/>IP publico]
        CM[ConfigMap e Secret]
        HPA[HPA<br/>CPU 60% e memoria 85%]
        subgraph DEP[Deployment - 2 a 5 replicas]
            POD[Pod<br/>API Spring Boot + Cloud SQL Auth Proxy]
        end
        LB --> POD
        CM --> POD
        HPA -.escala.-> DEP
    end

    SQL[(Cloud SQL<br/>PostgreSQL 16)]
    AR[Artifact Registry<br/>repositorio oficina]
    WIF[Workload Identity Federation<br/>sem chave JSON]
    BR[Brevo<br/>e-mail de status ao cliente]
    TF[Terraform - infra/<br/>estado remoto no GCS]

    CD -->|autentica via| WIF
    WIF -->|push da imagem| AR
    WIF -->|kubectl apply| GKE
    AR -->|pull da imagem| GKE
    POD -->|IAM + TLS<br/>Flyway aplica as migrations| SQL
    POD -.SMTP.-> BR
    TF -->|provisiona| GKE
    TF -->|provisiona| SQL
    TF -->|provisiona| AR
    TF -->|provisiona| WIF
